flowchart LR
    U[用户 / Chat UI] --> AUTH[认证与会话层\nLogin · Session · User Scope]
    AUTH --> SAFE[安全预检查\nCredentials · SQL mutation · Scope]
    SAFE --> ROUTER[LLM Semantic Router\ninput_mode + route]

    ROUTER --> Q[查询路由]
    ROUTER --> EX[解释路由]
    ROUTER --> X[执行路由]
    ROUTER --> P[规划路由]
    ROUTER --> V[View / 无关问题]
    ROUTER --> CL[Clarification / Pending]

    Q --> CTX[授权范围内有限上下文\nSemantic Catalog + Current User Sample]
    CTX --> IP[LLM IntentPlan\nNo SQL]
    IP --> VAL[Pydantic + Business Validation\nMetric · Date · Group · Enum]
    VAL --> COMP[Deterministic SQL Compiler]
    COMP --> RO[Read-only SQLite / PostgreSQL]
    RO --> RES[Result Formatter\nMetric Card · Table · Bar · Line]

    EX --> DEF[Published Metric Definitions\nNo database query]
    DEF --> RES

    P --> PARAM[LLM Parameter Extraction\nGoal · Floor · Horizon · Salary Delay]
    PARAM --> PV[Plan Parameter Validation]
    PV --> DATA[Read only required authorized data]
    DATA --> SIM[Deterministic Cashflow Simulator]
    SIM --> RES

    X --> PREVIEW[Transfer Preview\nRecipient · Amount]
    PREVIEW --> AUTHZ[Password Re-authentication\nCategory Selection]
    AUTHZ --> GATE[Deterministic Execution Gate]
    GATE --> ATOMIC[Atomic Synthetic Ledger Update\nPaired IN / OUT Entries]
    ATOMIC --> RES

    CL --> PSTATE[Structured Pending State\nKnown Slots · Missing Slots]
    PSTATE --> ROUTER
    V --> REJECT[Scope Response / Refusal\nNo ledger access]

    RES --> UI[Chat Response UI\nCards · Charts · Export]
    REJECT --> UI

